[[Image:Aldrassil.jpg|thumb|Aldrassil]]
'''Aldrassil''' is the giant tree at the center of [[Shadowglen]], which is located in the northeastern corner of [[Teldrassil]].

The leader of Shadowglen, [[Tenaron Stormgrip]], makes his home at the very top of Aldrassil.

It has [[class]] trainers for all [[night elf]] classes, although the spells available are capped at level 6. 


