'''Addle's Stead''' is located in southwestern [[Duskwood]], south of [[Raven Hill]] and west of the [[Vul'Gol Ogre Mound]]. It is one of the many abandoned farmsteads, presumably left behind when the darkness crept into Duskwood. The farm has been completely taken over by agents of the [[Defias Brotherhood]], who creep throughout the field, hide in the barn, and stalk in the small farmhouse. [[Alliance]]-aligned adventurers are sometimes brought here in search of an important docket that holds clues to the disappearance of [[Varian Wrynn]].

